# Implementation workflow and deliverables

1. Inspect the current source and identify concrete issues.
2. Fix Convergence scope drift and any Phase 5 correctness defects with targeted tests.
3. Implement the cohesive visual/material/environment improvements.
4. Implement character, weapon, enemy, Echo, and effect motion improvements without changing authoritative gameplay timing.
5. Polish HUD readability and mobile layout.
